# Optional bootstrap admin account.
# To auto-create an admin user during initial seed, set both ADMIN_CREDENTIAL and ADMIN_PASSWORD.
ADMIN_CREDENTIAL=admin@example.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=replace-with-a-strong-admin-password
ADMIN_NAME=Moto Admin

# ===== VERCEL DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST =====
# For production deployment on Vercel, ensure the following:
# 
# 1. Runtime Environment:
#    - Set NODE_ENV=production in Vercel Project Settings
#    - PORT is automatically managed by Vercel
#
# 2. Database Connection (Required):
#    - Use DATABASE_URL OR component-style variables (PGHOST, PGPORT, PGUSER, PGPASSWORD, PGDATABASE)
#    - Tip: Use Supabase pooler for serverless (transaction mode recommended)
#
# 3. Authentication & Security (Required):
#    - JWT_SECRET: Strong random string (minimum 32 characters)
#    - SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY: For backend operations
#    - SUPABASE_ANON_KEY: For frontend client
#
# 4. File Storage (Optional, if using hero video upload):
#    - BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN: Create in Vercel Storage settings
#
# 5. Admin Account (Optional):
#    - Set ADMIN_CREDENTIAL and ADMIN_PASSWORD to auto-create admin on first deployment
#
# 6. Database Pooling (Optional but recommended for serverless):
#    - PGPOOL_MAX: Connection pool size
#    - PG_IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS: Idle connection timeout
#    - PG_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_MS: Connection timeout
